{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"humble-cinnamoned-mussel","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context\n\nCurrent origin/main 104dc4e10a fails the locked complexity gate before pytest on every Gerrit Python matrix job. scripts/check_complexity_baseline.py --lock reports close_ticket in src/rebar/_commands/transition_close.py increased from its recorded ceiling 17 to 19. The likely introducing commit is 7405e9657f (Count cancelled link deletes as failed); the failure became visible after 104dc4e10a made survived gate-step failures authoritative. This blocks unrelated changes, including Gerrit 1681, even though their diffs do not touch transition_close.py or the complexity baseline.\n\n## Plan\n\n- Reproduce the lock failure from current origin/main.\n- Identify the added branches in close_ticket and extract an existing call-graph seam or otherwise simplify the function without raising the shrink-only baseline.\n- Add or retain focused tests for the cancelled-link-delete accounting behavior.\n- Keep .github/complexity-baseline.json unchanged unless the resulting score shrinks and the normal shrink-only updater removes a stale entry.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] python scripts/check_complexity_baseline.py --lock passes on a change based on current main.\n- [ ] close_ticket complexity is at or below its recorded ceiling of 17; the ceiling is not raised.\n- [ ] Cancelled link deletes remain counted as failed.\n- [ ] Focused transition/link-delete tests, make lint, make typecheck, and the full Gerrit gate pass.\n\n## Testing\n\nRun the locked complexity check with GITHUB_REPOSITORY=navapbc/rebar, focused transition/link-delete tests, make lint, make typecheck, and Gerrit Verified.","id":"657a-47a3-436f-4a16","parent_id":"","priority":1,"tags":["ci","complexity","regression"],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"Current main violates the shrink-only close_ticket complexity ceiling"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1786569452511028001,"uuid":"4416e349-8ddc-4c5c-b6e8-ff117a1aff14"}